    "provenance": "Base colour re-baked (Cycles CPU, emission, selected-to-active) from the approved TRELLIS source mesh; there is no rear-view projection, so the back, far side and underside are as TRELLIS invented them from the single approved concept. Tangent normals baked from the source geometry and whiteout-blended with colour relief; AO baked from the decimated geometry; roughness set inside declared regions (the horns and hooves by position) and otherwise the default, both reduced by colour detail; no metal and no dye mask (the goat is never dyed). Base colour kept at the TRELLIS bake's own tone (toneGamma 1): the first cook's lift (0.8) washed the dark coat of the approved concept out to a pale grey in game. Artistic derivation, not measured PBR."
  },
